Type: Package
Package: hpcR
Title: Submit Jobs to High Performance Computing Clusters
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    c(person("Zach", "Vig", , "zachvig@unc.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Michael", "Hallquist", role = c("aut")))
Description: hpcR provides a simple interface for building jobs to submit to
    a high-performance cluster (HPC) and tracking them post-submission. For
    the more advanced user, the package also provides a straightforward but 
    robust system for creating job dependencies/sequences for larger-scale
    projects.
